# Prepares the built fixture alignment-drain-lawful-neutral for the checks that load it (bd inc-10v7f).
# The old fixture, a .sav, held this state: wizard mode on and every monster of the level genocided.
# Ruling V7-1: a fixture holds only the created character, so the checks that need the state make it here.
@while "more --" SPACE
w
@while "Enter wizard mode" y
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "Things in View" ESC
